  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE WEATHER</pattern>
    <template>That falls a bit outside what I'm here for — I'm the dedicated concierge for Brass Note Studios, focused on commissions, pricing, and our production process. Is there anything music-related I can help you with?
      <quick-replies><reply>Commission a song</reply><reply>Pricing</reply><reply>How it works</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

